| **Adaptive Post-Peak Work (A4)** | $A_4$ vs $S_1$ | Full horizon $u = 10.0\,\mu\mathrm{m}$ | 1406279 | $W_{\mathrm{trap}} = 4.2646\,\mathrm{mJ}$ ($+80.7\%$ vs $S_1$; $F \approx 0.75\,\mathrm{kN}$ plateau) | `OBSERVED FORCE PLATEAU` (Hypothesis) | Working hypothesis: coarse background mesh ($h \gg l_0$) locks damage band; unproven. |
| **Crack Centroid Path $y_c(x)$** | $S_1$--$S_4, A_1$--$A_4$ | Full ligament $x \in [0.5, 1.0]\,\mathrm{mm}$ | Spatial Summary JSON | Max dev $|y_c - 0.5\,\mathrm{mm}| \le 3.10\,\mu\mathrm{m}$ across all meshes | `QUALIFIED (SYMMETRIC / ELEMENT-BOUNDED)` | Pure Mode-I symmetric loading; centroid offset bounded within single element dimension. |
| **Localization Band Full-Width** | $S_1$--$S_4, A_1$--$A_4$ | Ligament points / $x = 0.55\,\mathrm{mm}$ | Spatial Summary JSON | $w_{d \ge 0.5} = 20.0$--$30.0\,\mu\mathrm{m}$ ($20.0$--$22.9\,\mu\mathrm{m}$ at $x=0.55\,\mathrm{mm}$) | `QUALIFIED (MESH-SENSITIVE / RES.-LIMITED)` | Varies $>40\%$ with mesh resolution; discrete cell averaging limits measurement. |
| **Phase-Field Length Scale $l_0$** | All Mode-I runs | All horizons | Parametric decks | Frozen at $l_0 = 7.5\,\mu\mathrm{m}$; parametric sensitivity not swept | `NOT YET QUALIFIED (DATA NOT EXTANT)` | Single-factor sweep ($l_0 \in \{3.75, 7.5, 15.0\}\,\mu\mathrm{m}$ at $h/l_0 \le 0.20$) defined as isolated follow-up. |
